		type: "Edible",
		thc: "10mg",
		weight: "50 Pack",
		price: 350,
		description: `Each gummy contains exactly 10mg of lab-tested THC — consistent dose every time. Fruit-flavoured, no combustion needed. Onset takes 45–90 minutes and effects last 4–8 hours.

